lt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:179c4e2f-a568-40be-b9c6-25c2541aeb12\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a chest inside the <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling_Hideout\" title=\"Tiefling Hideout\">Tiefling Hideout</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Druid_Grove\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Druid Grove\">Druid Grove</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item can also be looted from the corpse of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barth\" title=\"Barth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Portrait_Barth.png/25px-Portrait_Barth.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Portrait_Barth.png/38px-Portrait_Barth.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Portrait_Barth.png/50px-Portrait_Barth.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Portrait_Barth.png/25px-Portrait_Barth.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/Portrait_Barth.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Barth\" title=\"Barth\">Barth</a> if he dies outside the grove.</li>\n<li>It features in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Return_the_Locket\" title=\"Return the Locket\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Return the Locket\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Return_the_Locket\" title=\"Return the Locket\">Return the Locket</a>; after the quest is finished its only nominal value is for <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">trading</a>.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"verify that it even can b...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200134\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.096 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.100 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2768/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 45471/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8569/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.026/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1218461/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   79.482      1 -total\n 98.55%   78.332      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n 35.39%   28.132     10 Template:Uid\n 22.08%   17.546     29 Template:Trim\n 21.21%   16.862      6 Template:Icon_text\n 16.13%   12.822      3 Template:Icon_link\n 13.32%   10.586      5 Template:Uuid\n 12.87%   10.232      7 Template:Ifempty\n 12.31%    9.785     10 Template:Template_style\n 11.83%    9.399      1 Template:WeaponType\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:id